OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain,
OL,6,Flocally heavy will continue to move
OL,7,Fnorth across Scotland and also
OL,8,Fpersisting across northeast England.
OL,9,FVariable cloud and a few showers
OL,10,Felsewhere, with perhaps some
OL,11,Fthunderstorms towards the southeast.
OL,12,FFeeling generally warm and humid.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FBands of rain and showers
OL,15,Fmoving across many parts throughout
OL,16,FFriday, with most persistent rain
OL,17,Ftowards the northeast. Driest across
OL,18,FNorthern Ireland and perhaps southeast
OL,19,FEngland. Temperatures nearer average.
